  "notes": "\n### Behind the scenes\n- **Bug reports:** Krate keeps a log of what it did and of any errors.\n  Settings → About → **Copy log** copies it for a report.\n- **Modules:** Settings → Modules is where optional downloads (audio\n  analysis, file conversion and the like) will appear. Each is signed by\n  Krate and checked before it's installed. None are available yet.\n- Tighter security: the window only runs Krate's own code.\n\n### Player\n- The frame rate meter sits next to the 1 deck / 2 decks buttons and counts\n  both decks (it used to show only on deck A, so a playing deck B wasn't\n  measured).\n\n",
